1
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:04,790
Buying, selling or renting a home
still runs on endless calls,

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:06,600
messages and follow-ups.

3
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:12,040
Agents juggle chat groups and
spreadsheets, buyers wait for updates,

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:15,370
and sellers rarely know who's interested.

5
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:20,470
Today, we're launching DealSaathi:
an AI-powered real estate workspace for agents,

6
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:21,990
buyers and sellers.

7
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:29,060
Agents get one dashboard for their
leads, listings, viewings and follow-ups.

8
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,880
They can add a lead just by
describing it in plain words,

9
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,920
and DealSaathi's AI fills in the details.

10
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,850
Sellers list a property in minutes,

11
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:42,150
and it's matched against every
buyer's saved requirements.

12
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:49,430
Buyers see what fits them, tap
"I'm interested", and make an offer.

13
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:56,030
Their agent forwards it to
the owner, the owner can counter,

14
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:59,310
and the buyer accepts in principle.

15
00:01:00,570 --> 00:01:02,520
Every step notifies the right people,

16
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:05,960
and the buyer's identity
stays private from the seller.

17
00:01:08,721 --> 00:01:12,501
Each agent connects their own Gmail,
Slack and Google Calendar, for alerts,

18
00:01:12,561 --> 00:01:16,611
reminders, and viewings booked
straight into their calendar.

19
00:01:20,486 --> 00:01:22,326
We built DealSaathi with Claude Code,

20
00:01:22,386 --> 00:01:26,566
starting from one detailed prompt
and refining it along the way.

21
00:01:27,586 --> 00:01:31,196
The ViaSocket SDK gave us
those integrations and the AI,

22
00:01:31,256 --> 00:01:33,726
without building each
connection from scratch.

23
00:01:35,116 --> 00:01:40,576
And Embarko took it live: one hosting
prompt, and Claude Code deployed it,

24
00:01:40,956 --> 00:01:43,766
with traffic and scheduled
jobs in one dashboard.

25
00:01:44,816 --> 00:01:49,126
Every release since, up to
the design you just saw, was built,

26
00:01:49,186 --> 00:01:51,296
tested and shipped the same way.

27
00:01:53,951 --> 00:01:55,221
DealSaathi is live today.

28
00:01:55,281 --> 00:01:59,911
Sign up as a buyer or a seller,
or bring your team of agents.

29
00:02:01,171 --> 00:02:05,231
Built with Claude Code, powered by
the ViaSocket SDK, and hosted on Embarko.

30
00:02:06,351 --> 00:02:11,001
DealSaathi: find, show and agree on
property, with your agent alongside.
